    "title": "只是 + qualifying clause",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-degree-p14-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "只是 + qualifying clause",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "只是 introduces a limitation or qualification of an earlier statement. It can concede the main point while adding a reservation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "书很好，只是太贵了。",
                "pinyin": "shū hěn hǎo ， zhǐshì tài guì le 。",
                "meaning": "The book is good; it is just too expensive.",
                "audio": "26aed129c1023beddd39e1dbf85e1b089e31a3bca4ddb0007b7674b9899fd3ad"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想去，只是没时间。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù ， zhǐshì méi shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "I want to go; I just do not have time.",
                "audio": "a5aba926866bee2ce9bc2fc3c850a6e0aa4acd67acdd1edfdf78512338eaeb53"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "只是",
                "pinyin": "zhǐshì",
                "meaning": "merely; only",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "1a932b8da03948e66e84531daee9ee5f1693bc1b41d211147a4159bdb4951f16"
              }
            ]
          }
